        <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic_1af143fe02e2bcf20c6d0d8e3d261ac1a2" kindref="member">MaterialGradientEnhancedHypoElastic::computePlaneStress</ref>, which also yields the energy tangents of the converged 3D update. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">res</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Response, as for <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic_1af143fe02e2bcf20c6d0d8e3d261ac1a2" kindref="member">MaterialGradientEnhancedHypoElastic::computePlaneStress</ref>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">tan</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Algorithmic tangents of the converged 3D update. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">inc</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Increment of the in-plane strain and the nonlocal variables. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="out">energyTan</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Derivatives of the updated elastic energy density and dissipation wrt the 3D strain increment and the nonlocal variables; the condensation of the free strains <formula id="36">$\varepsilon_{33}, \gamma_{13}, \gamma_{23}$</formula> is left to the element.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
The default is the plane stress iteration of <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic_1af143fe02e2bcf20c6d0d8e3d261ac1a2" kindref="member">MaterialGradientEnhancedHypoElastic::computePlaneStress</ref> (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic_1a133158b47d2c9a2aa36cccea061684a3" kindref="member">MaterialGradientEnhancedHypoElastic::iteratePlaneStress</ref>) around <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic_energy_tangent_provider_1a4d08c0d60cb83a1ec89fc9702fa91608" kindref="member">computeStressWithEnergyTangents()</ref>. A material that overrides <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic_1af143fe02e2bcf20c6d0d8e3d261ac1a2" kindref="member">MaterialGradientEnhancedHypoElastic::computePlaneStress</ref> overrides this method consistently, so that the stress does not depend on whether energy tangents are requested. The class providing the capability must also be a <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_materials_1_1_material_gradient_enhanced_hypo_elastic" kindref="compound">MaterialGradientEnhancedHypoElastic</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
